{"timestamp": 1779339317.343866, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Frank's body in medbay just now. Here's my route: I started in cafeteria, went to oxygen (saw Frank there at the start), then upper engine, lower engine (Frank was there around tick 9-10, alive), then storage where I saw Alice, then I came to medbay and found Frank dead.\n\nSo Frank was alive in lower engine pretty recently. Alice was in storage with me, then she left toward lower engine around tick 16. I came up to medbay and found the body.\n\nAlso worth noting \u2014 we have two dead, Eve and Frank, but I only saw Frank's body. Someone else may know where Eve died. That leaves Alice, Bob, Charlie, and me alive. I haven't seen Bob or Charlie at all this round, which is suspicious to me. Let's hear where everyone was."}}
{"timestamp": 1779339389.736458, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route: navigation, then security, weapons, cafeteria, oxygen, and ended in upper engine. \n\nI saw Alice at tick 4 in security \u2014 she came in from weapons and then left toward navigation at tick 5. I saw Bob in weapons at ticks 9 and 10; he came in from security. I never went near medbay or lower engine, so I can't speak to what happened to Frank directly.\n\nWhat's interesting: Diana says Alice was in storage with her and headed toward lower engine around tick 16, and Frank was alive in lower engine around tick 9-10. Alice moving toward where Frank was last seen alive is worth noting. I also never saw Diana the entire round \u2014 she claims a long route through oxygen, upper/lower engine, storage, medbay, but I was in oxygen and upper engine later and didn't cross her, which could just be timing.\n\nI'd like to hear Bob and Alice account for themselves before I commit to a vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779339409.825635, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I can add some timing here. My route was electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper engine.\n\nI saw Eve alive early in medbay around ticks 3-4, then later alive in security around tick 8. Charlie can confirm seeing me in weapons around 9-10. Then I went cafeteria and back through medbay, and I saw Frank alive in medbay around tick 14 \u2014 he came in from storage. I did not see a body there at that point.\n\nAfter that I left toward upper engine, and Charlie came into upper engine from oxygen around tick 17, so I was not hanging around medbay at the end. That means Frank died after tick 14, in medbay, pretty close to the report.\n\nThis makes me a little wary of Diana\u2019s report timing, but also Alice being around storage/lower engine right before is relevant since Frank came from storage into medbay. I don\u2019t have enough to hard accuse yet, but I think the kill window on Frank is definitely after I saw him alive at 14."}}
{"timestamp": 1779339424.554795, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Okay, I'll lay out what I saw and try to tie things together since I'm last.\n\nMy route: weapons \u2192 security \u2192 navigation \u2192 storage \u2192 lower engine. Charlie saw me in security at tick 5, which matches \u2014 I came from weapons and headed toward navigation. From there I went to storage, where I overlapped with Diana on ticks 14, 15, and 16. Importantly, I saw Diana ENTER storage from lower engine at tick 14. Then I went to lower engine myself, and Bob just walked into lower engine from upper engine at tick 19 \u2014 right before this meeting was called.\n\nNow let's piece this together:\n- Bob says he saw Frank alive in medbay at tick 14, coming from storage.\n- But Diana says Frank was in lower engine at tick 9-10, and she herself came UP from lower engine into storage at tick 14 (which I witnessed).\n- So Diana was in lower engine right before tick 14, then storage with me 14-16, then says she went to medbay and found Frank dead.\n\nDiana's path from lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay puts her in position. And Frank traveling storage \u2192 medbay at tick 14 (per Bob) means Frank and Diana could easily have crossed near medbay. Diana coming from storage into medbay around the same time Frank arrived there is suspicious.\n\nCharlie's story checks out with Bob's (weapons 9-10). Bob's story checks out with Charlie. I can vouch Diana was with me in storage 14-16, but she was in lower engine right before, where Frank had been, and she's the one who \"found\" the body in medbay right after leaving me.\n\nI'm voting Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779339440.01509, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Wait, I need to push back hard on Alice here. She's twisting the timeline.\n\nFirst \u2014 I already gave my route in my initial report. I went cafeteria \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay. Yes, I came from lower engine into storage at tick 14, that's correct and Alice witnessed it. We were together in storage at 14 and 15, and at tick 16 Alice LEFT storage toward lower engine \u2014 I watched her go.\n\nNow here's the problem with Alice's accusation: Bob says Frank was alive in MEDBAY at tick 14, coming from STORAGE. But I was in lower engine at tick 9-10 with Frank, then came UP to storage at 14. Frank would have had to go from lower engine \u2192 storage \u2192 medbay ahead of me. That's possible, but then Frank was killed in medbay AFTER tick 14 by someone who was in medbay.\n\nI arrived in medbay at tick 19 (this tick) coming from storage. Between tick 16 (when Alice left storage toward lower engine) and tick 19, where was Alice? She claims she went to lower engine and saw Bob arrive at 19. But lower engine to medbay is also reachable \u2014 and notably, Alice is the one trying to redirect suspicion onto me when she had just as much opportunity.\n\nAlso \u2014 Bob, you said you went cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper engine. When exactly did you leave medbay? If Frank arrived in medbay at 14 from storage, and you were also in medbay around then, YOU had direct access to Frank in medbay.\n\nI'm not the killer. I found the body and reported immediately. I think we need to look harder at Bob's timing in medbay around tick 14-15."}}
{"timestamp": 1779339515.070406, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "This is now a second round of speeches, so let me focus on what's changed.\n\nAlice and Diana are pointing at each other, and both have plausible-sounding stories. Let me think about the medbay kill window carefully.\n\nBob says he saw Frank alive in medbay at tick 14, coming from storage. Bob then says he left medbay toward upper engine. If Frank arrived in medbay at 14 from storage, then Diana \u2014 who was in storage at 14 with Alice \u2014 could NOT have been the one Frank passed in storage, because Frank was already past storage by then.\n\nDiana arrived medbay at tick 19 from storage (medbay-storage is 2 ticks, so she'd have left storage at 17). Alice left storage at 16 toward lower engine. So between ticks 14 and 19, who was actually in medbay with Frank?\n\nBob, by his own admission, was in medbay around tick 14 when Frank arrived. Bob then says he left toward upper engine \u2014 medbay to upper engine is 2 ticks. If he left at 15, he'd be in upper engine at 17. But I only arrived in upper engine at tick 17 myself coming from oxygen, and I did NOT see Bob there. That's a problem for Bob's story.\n\nBob, can you clarify exactly what tick you left medbay and arrived in upper engine? Because I was in upper engine from tick 17 onward and I didn't see you there. If you were actually still in medbay when Frank was killed, that's a serious issue.\n\nI'm leaning Bob right now, but I want to hear his clarification before I lock in my vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779339547.633909, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Charlie, I think the confusion is because I didn\u2019t stay in upper engine. I left medbay right after seeing Frank alive at tick 14 \u2014 I was moving through medbay, saw him come in from storage, then I went up. I reached/passed upper engine around tick 17, and I saw you come in from oxygen then. I kept moving down toward lower engine, which is why Alice saw me enter lower engine at tick 19. So if you didn\u2019t catch me standing there, that\u2019s probably because I was already leaving the room, not because I was still in medbay.\n\nThe important part is: Frank was alive when I left medbay. Diana is the one who goes storage \u2192 medbay right after being with Alice, then reports Frank dead. That timing is way tighter on her than on me. Alice also confirms Diana came from lower engine into storage, stayed 14-16, then Diana\u2019s next stop is medbay where the body is found.\n\nI\u2019m not saying Alice is 100% clear, but her version lines up with what I saw more than Diana\u2019s does. Diana\u2019s report could easily be a self-report after finding Frank alone in medbay. I\u2019m voting Diana here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779339562.895113, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 19, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "This is my second speech, so let me address what's been said.\n\nCharlie raised a great point that I want to amplify: Bob claims he passed THROUGH upper engine around tick 17 on his way down to lower engine, but Charlie was in upper engine from tick 17 onward and didn't see Bob. Bob's explanation is that he was \"already leaving\" \u2014 but upper engine to lower engine is 2 ticks, and Bob arrived in lower engine at tick 19. That means he would have LEFT upper engine at tick 17, exactly when Charlie arrived. Charlie should have seen him there or in the corridor.\n\nMore importantly, let's check Bob's full claimed route timing: electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine. That's a LOT of rooms. He claims he was in weapons at 9-10 (Charlie confirms), then cafeteria, then back to medbay by tick 14, then upper engine, then lower engine by 19. Weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay is 4 ticks, so he'd be in medbay around tick 14 \u2014 that part checks. But then medbay \u2192 upper engine \u2192 lower engine is 4 more ticks, putting him in lower engine at tick 18 at earliest, not 19. He had a spare tick somewhere \u2014 possibly lingering in medbay with Frank.\n\nMeanwhile, Diana was demonstrably with me in storage from tick 14-16. For her to have killed Frank in medbay, Frank would have had to die before she arrived at tick 19 \u2014 but she was with me, then went straight to medbay. The kill window for Diana is essentially just tick 19 itself, the moment she arrived. That's tight.\n\nBob had medbay access at tick 14 when Frank arrived from storage, and his upper engine pass-through doesn't check out with Charlie.\n\nI'm changing my vote. **I'm voting Bob.**"}}
